Package: dicomtk
Type: Package
Title: Comprehensive 'DICOM' Toolkit for Medical Imaging
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yee How", "Lau", email = "lauyeehow1986@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("John", "Muschelli", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Original dcmtk R wrapper"),
    person("OFFIS e.V.", role = "cph",
           comment = "DCMTK C++ library"))
Description: A comprehensive R interface to the 'DICOM' Toolkit ('DCMTK'),
    providing native R bindings for reading, writing, modifying, and visualizing
    Digital Imaging and Communications in Medicine ('DICOM') files. Features
    include 'tidyverse'-compliant data structures, 'ggplot2'-based image
    visualization, interactive 'Shiny' viewers, 'PACS' networking (C-ECHO,
    C-FIND, C-STORE, C-MOVE), structured report handling, 'DICOM' deidentification,
    and integration with local and cloud-based large language models ('LLM')
    via 'Ollama' and 'OpenAI'-compatible APIs for AI-assisted medical image
    analysis. The 'DCMTK' C++ library is bundled and compiled from source,
    requiring no external installation.
License: GPL (>= 2)
